Description: Lightweight, friendly, local-first Linux desktop companion
 BB-8 Buddy is a tiny, persistent, always-available desktop companion
 that gently checks in every 30 minutes with the user.
 Features:
  * Timed check-ins with customizable intervals (15, 30, 45, 60m)
  * Voice or text input with local storage
  * Smart pause when system is idle
  * Beautiful timeline dashboard with analytics and daily streaks
  * Native system tray integration and desktop notifications
  * Markdown and CSV export
  * 100% private, local-only, zero cloud dependencies

